                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mara Waseba wakawashambulia, wakawachukua wakaenda nao; naam, wamewaua hao watumishi kwa makali ya upanga, mimi peke yangu nimepona, mimi tu, kukuletea habari. ",
